  "project_description": "This module allows you to import redirects from a JSON file uisng UI and allows you to map the key properties from a JSON object.\n\n Installations: \n\nAs usaul, use composer to download composer require drupal/import_redirect_json .\n\n Dependencies: \n\n \n Redirect \n Database logging (in the core) \n \n Configurations: \n\nGo to /admin/config/search/redirect/import-redirect-json/mapping path and map the fields.\n\n See in action: \n\nGo to /admin/config/search/redirect/import-redirect-json path and upload a JSON file with mapped pattern. You will see an example on the import form based on your mapping fields. (See below an example)\n\n [\n\n {\n\n \"source_path\": \"/from-url\",\n\n \"destination\": \"internal:/node/{ID}\",\n\n \"status_code\": \"301\",\n\n \"language\": \"en\"\n\n }\n\n] \n\n Looking forward to see new issues 😄\n\n Thanks,",
